      "section_kind": "volume",
      "volume_candidate": 7,
      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "十一月壬寅，詔文武羣臣集議營建北京。丙午，召張輔還。戊申，漢王高煦有罪，削二護衞。徙山東、山西、湖廣流民於保安州，賜復三年。",
      "boundary_basis": "epub_source_paragraph",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "flags": [],
